<article id="post-264847" class="post-264847 id_project type-id_project status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tag-joao-paulo-soares tag-malia-agostinelli id_tax_domain-homes id_tax_domain-residential">
	<div class="entry-content">
		
<div class="wp-block-sandow-article-header article-header">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-header" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 65%"><img decoding="async" width="1500" height="1000" src="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2.jpg" alt="living room that opens to the outdoor space" class="wp-image-264848" srcset="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2.jpg 1500w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">The living spaces are fully integrated with floor-to-ceiling windows that open the house to its surroundings, enhancing the natural light.</figcaption></figure>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column article-header_meta is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:25%"><p class="article-date" aria-label="Post Date">October 2, 2025</p>


<p class="wp-block-sandow-byline byline size-regular"><span>Words: </span><a href="/tag/malia-agostinelli">Malia Agostinelli</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-sandow-byline byline size-regular"><span>Photography: </span><a href="/tag/joao-paulo-soares">João Paulo Soares</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column article-header_content is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:75%"><h1 class="wp-block-post-title">Discover The Duality Of This Striking Brazilian Home</h1>


<p class="size-regular">Settled on a steep slope in São Roque, Brazil, Casa 258 conveys a dual narrative between shadow and light, forest and valley. On one side, the glowing façade sits open to the sunset and valley below; on the other, the house is enveloped by the soft shade of the surrounding forest.</p>



<p class="size-regular">Pedro Cornetta, founder of <a href="https://cornettaarquitetura.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Cornetta Arquitetura</a>, carefully chose the location of this house to celebrate the core principle of the project: to integrate its construction with the surroundings, enabling the house to merge with its environment. Casa 258’s dual condition created a volumetric challenge that ultimately defined the project’s architectural language. Built into the terrain, the house appears to be single-story; however, the street view reveals two levels.</p>



<h2>Cornetta Arquitetura Plants Casa 258 In Nature</h2>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%"><img decoding="async" width="1500" height="1000" src="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-5.jpg" alt="Exterior of home with steel columns and light steel-and-wood roof" class="wp-image-264851" srcset="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-5.jpg 1500w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-5-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-5-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Slender steel columns support the heavy slab, while the light steel-and-wood roof seems to float above the concrete base. </figcaption></figure>



<p class="size-regular">Cornetta says the design draws inspiration from the Atlantic Forest and striking environment of native Brazil. “Architecturally, the project integrates a raw materiality—centered on exposed concrete­—that evokes Latin American modernism, combined with more contemporary elements such as the minimalist structural steel profiles.”&nbsp;</p>



<p class="size-regular">This steel structure is critical to achieving a visually light construction, accounting for large spans and broad glass openings, which connect the interior spaces to both sides of the terrain. The lower floor is composed entirely of exposed concrete and rough stone, anchoring the home into the steep slope. The main structure of the house is an explosion of artisanal style delicately balancing the steel structure with charred wood panels.</p>



<h3>Embracing São Roque&#8217;s Natural Landscape</h3>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1500" height="1000" src="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-4.jpg" alt="living room with charred wood furnishings" class="wp-image-264850" srcset="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-4.jpg 1500w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-4-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">The use of charred wood establishes a striking presence. </figcaption></figure>



<p class="size-regular">The charred wood panels, created using the<em> Shou Sugi Ban </em>technique, convey an alluring narrative which is in contrast with the light tones of the floor and ceilings, both made of Tauari wood. “We were seeking a material that could also create a bond with the surrounding without introducing visual noise.” Cornetta explains. “The charred pine naturally emerged as the right solution, as it brings together all of these aspects.”</p>



<p class="size-regular">The resulting space combines precision with sensitivity, and an integration to its surrounding landscape. Its silent elegance is displayed in its dual composition, which is decidedly at one with nature. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%"><img decoding="async" width="1500" height="1000" src="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2.jpg" alt="living room that opens to the outdoor space" class="wp-image-264848" srcset="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2.jpg 1500w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-2-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">The living spaces are fully integrated with floor-to-ceiling windows that open the house to its surroundings, enhancing the natural light.</figcaption></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1500" height="1000" src="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-3.jpg" alt="kitchen with wood cabinetry and all black marble island" class="wp-image-264849" srcset="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-3.jpg 1500w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-3-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Natural wood veneer cabinetry reinforces the cohesive aesthetic. </figcaption></figure>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1500" height="2250" src="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-6.jpg" alt="lower story of the home" class="wp-image-264852" srcset="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-6.jpg 1500w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-6-200x300.jpg 200w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-6-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-6-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-6-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-6-1365x2048.jpg 1365w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">The lower story is built with concrete and stone, blending the home into the surrounding terrain. </figcaption></figure>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1500" height="2251" src="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258.jpg" alt="bedroom with glass windows and view of the surrounding forest" class="wp-image-264853" srcset="https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258.jpg 1500w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-200x300.jpg 200w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-682x1024.jpg 682w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-768x1153.jpg 768w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://interiordesign.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Interior-Design_Casa258-1365x2048.jpg 1365w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">The bedroom reinforces the visual connection between the interiors and the surrounding forest. </figcaption></figure>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>



